  "contracts": [
    "4754A0/4759E0 nativecdecl5args with unused first slot; portable APIs omit that slot, returnvoid. Restore4 actual map backups and real485830 before clipping/count reset.",
    "Paving predicate47B8E0 native fullEAX0/1 proven; byteC API widening exact. Garden470900 consumer isAL only; actual full entry tables used.",
    "Paving restores footprint/propertyBYTE B285CC,edgeBYTE B67D1C,clearedBYTE AE8E7C andDWORDterrain AF598C. Actual475720 refresh runs. Gardens retain exactEEFFD77F mask, actual transientBYTE+18 and real476530 refresh.",
    "BridgeState16B:U32direction,I32length,I32available,U32step; ADC36C BYTE pieces, AF598C DWORDterrain. Onlymode==1 min5/middle, everymode!=0 shipglyphs; one signed-negative direction correction by8.",
    "Actual water/citizen/noncitizen routing initializers execute in that order; no result providers or callback substitutions. Active ferry callbacks must be the genuine existing ferry implementation."
